   <indicator ascending="0" measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output Indicator</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. Number of needs assessment and gap analysis in relation to IAT, SALW control, possession and misuse and weapons categorization;
2. Number of trainings on information gathering, information sharing and information analysis and number of trainings on weapons categorization;
3. Number of comprehensive trainings on IAT of converted firearms developed and delivered;
4. Number of police officers that attended a converted firearms workshop;
5. Frequency (number) of meetings between investigation teams and FFP across the border and between the agencies;
6. Number of JIT and SOPs on converted firearms investigations;
7. Number of knowledge products developed, printed and disseminated;
8. Frequency (number) of coordination meetings organized for development of harmonized procedures for cyber-crime investigations;
9. Number of press stories on the dangers of misuse and trafficking of SALW published;
10. Number of public awareness campaigns on the dangers of misuse and trafficking of SALW carried out</narrative>
    </description>
